flowchart LR
  Browser[React and Vite client] -->|credentialed HTTP| Express[Express server]
  Browser <-->|WebSocket| ServerWS[Server WebSocket modules]
  Express --> Routes[Route registration]
  Routes --> Auth[Authentication and permissions]
  Routes --> Services[Assessment, AI, analytics, LTI, billing, proctoring services]
  Services --> Storage[Storage adapter]
  Storage --> Drizzle[Drizzle ORM and Neon driver]
  Drizzle --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL-compatible database)]
  Schema[Shared schema and validation] --> Routes
  Schema --> Storage
  Mobile[Separate Expo and React Native workspace] -. app workspace .-> Shared[Shared contracts]
